2. Embedded management console
------------------------------

The Go binary embeds assets/console/dist through go:embed. The embedded
bundle contains the following component.

Component | Version | License | Copyright / attribution
--- | --- | --- | ---
Vue and @vue/* runtime packages | 3.5.44 | MIT | Copyright (c) 2018-present, Yuxi (Evan) You

Vite, TypeScript, vue-tsc, Vitest and jsdom are build-only and are not
part of the embedded bundle. The console uses system fonts and original
Basalt interface assets; it contains no third-party images or fonts.


