Notes:

- Shiki 2.5.0 and @shikijs/* 2.5.0 are build-only. The build uses them
  to pre-render syntax-highlighted HTML; no Shiki runtime is shipped.
- Site search is disabled. DocSearch JavaScript, MiniSearch, mark.js,
  focus-trap and @iconify-json/simple-icons are not part of the runtime
  bundle. The DocSearch CSS is included by VitePress's default theme.
- The full dependency graph is pinned in website/package-lock.json.


4. Assets and fonts
-------------------

The SVG diagrams, illustrations, brand marks, CLI demo transcript and
local demo model are original Basalt content under Apache-2.0. No
third-party images are included. The Inter font files are the only
third-party assets distributed with the website.


