6. Redistribution
-----------------

Any source archive, binary archive, container image or website build that
redistributes Basalt must include LICENSE, NOTICE and this file. The
current CI build produces raw binaries for linux/amd64, linux/arm64,
windows/amd64 and darwin/arm64; its uploaded binary artifact includes
LICENSE, NOTICE and this file alongside those binaries. CI does not
create release archives. Release packaging, when added, must include
these three files in each archive. The website build redistributes the
components listed in section 3 and includes copies of these three files
at the site root.
